ll Levels) \\n\\n  ### Software Engineer (All Levels)\\n\\n  #### Abridge\\n\\n  New York, NY   $178,500.00 - $290,000.00\\n Software Engineer, Frontend \\n\\n  ### Software Engineer, Frontend\\n\\n  #### Wealthfront\\n\\n  Seattle, WA   $140,000.00 - $185,000.00\\n Software Developer", "score": 0.49670476, "raw_content": null}, {"title": "Introduction to LangChain - GeeksforGeeks", "url": "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/artificial-intelligence/introduction-to-langchain/", "content": "Report\\n\\nLangChain is an open-source framework designed to simplify the creation of applications using large language models (LLMs). It provides a standard interface for integrating with other tools and end-to-end chains for common applications. It helps AI developers connect LLMs such as GPT-4 with external data and computation. This framework comes for both Python and JavaScript.\\n\\nKey benefits include:", "score": 0.4598771, "raw_content": null}], "response_time": 5.61, "request_id": "56afc0d2-496d-4afe-8068-d00dbae1317c"}', name='tavily_search', id='19ebd1bd-7c98-4709-8dd9-f1c9212678b5', tool_call_id='call_z1rdBeMDhdTi1earC7AhMo9r'), ToolMessage(content='{"query": "\\"LangChain\\" \\"Machine Learning Engineer\\" \\"San Francisco\\"", "follow_up_questions": null, "answer": null, "images": [], "results": [{"url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/education-engineer-at-langchain-4318297923", "title": "LangChain hiring Education Engineer in San Francisco, CA", "content": "About the role:LangChain is looking for an Education Engineer to help developers and agent builders learn how to build with LangChain, LangGraph, and LangSmith. In this role, you’ll turn cutting-edge applied AI work into accessible, engaging educational content including hands-on live workshops and meetups to online courses and recorded video tutorials. [...] A clear, engaging communication style—both written and on camera.\\n Experience designing and teaching technical content for developers (courses, workshops